  "headline": "Equal deployed-policy budget + env access: VCC2 0.779 >> CLEAR-env-v2 0.616 > RECALL-env-v2 0.580. Both replay methods LEARN T8 but FAIL T9 (diag 0.0); VCC learns it (0.99). Env access alone does not close the gap; the one-sided floor (vs symmetric clone/distill) is what lets the last task be learned.",
